    "name": "Shatterland",
    "steam_appid": 3721680,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/7dddf540dee0a494a89d1643243ee890.avif?t=1755522488\" width=610 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/aff6c9aea73424ec5e38731428416f82.avif?t=1755522488\" width=610 height=88 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea Uncover Your Past</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ruins of a secret lab, recover lost files, and piece together the truth along with fragments of your stolen powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/7fced742dd4d318e12fa946ad71d6557.poster.avif?t=1755522488\" width=798 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/7fced742dd4d318e12fa946ad71d6557.webm?t=1755522488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/7fced742dd4d318e12fa946ad71d6557.mp4?t=1755522488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were taken as a child.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ripped from your home and locked away in a hidden laboratory. You were different your parents knew it. The government knew it. And they wanted to use you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tested. Modified. Controlled. You were meant to be a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the experiment failed. Your powers were stolen, replicated, and twisted. Instead of strength, the military\u2019s project unleashed devastation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world collapsed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/9f81f268daed7a68f277f3f7ccf10dbe.avif?t=1755522488\" width=610 height=88 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d Open-World Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in a vast post-apocalyptic wasteland filled with zombies, hostile survivors, and the remnants of the military that created you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/e0f6ef34fc030a5ab68154afb1cd1806.poster.avif?t=1755522488\" width=800 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/e0f6ef34fc030a5ab68154afb1cd1806.webm?t=1755522488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/e0f6ef34fc030a5ab68154afb1cd1806.mp4?t=1755522488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/2281e0270cdaf3d2b9e3f4b989fc94c1.avif?t=1755522488\" width=610 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shatterland</strong> is a survival/exploration open-world zombie game featuring base-building, skill progression, and online co-op play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot, fight, and explore a shattered world while reclaiming your past.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Stylized Low-Poly World</strong><br>A unique visual style that brings clarity and charm to your survival journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d <strong>Survive Together</strong><br>Play solo or in online co-op. Team up to share resources, build stronger defenses, and face greater threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddf <strong>Fight to Survive</strong><br>Battle hordes of the undead, hostile survivors, and twisted military experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Loot &amp; Equip</strong><br>Find powerful firearms, melee weapons, and survival gear to improve your chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Vehicle System</strong><br>Repair, upgrade, and maintain vehicles to traverse the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd5\ufe0f <strong>Build &amp; Barricade</strong><br>Create safe zones anywhere. Fortify your shelter and hold out against the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Weather &amp; Day/Night Cycle</strong><br>Adapt to changing conditions where every hour brings new dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Skill-Based Progression</strong><br>Level up by surviving. Unlock new abilities and reclaim fragments of your stolen power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Trade &amp; Customize</strong><br>Barter with survivors, adjust difficulty, and tailor the experience to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/7dddf540dee0a494a89d1643243ee890.avif?t=1755522488\" width=610 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/aff6c9aea73424ec5e38731428416f82.avif?t=1755522488\" width=610 height=88 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea Uncover Your Past</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ruins of a secret lab, recover lost files, and piece together the truth along with fragments of your stolen powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/7fced742dd4d318e12fa946ad71d6557.poster.avif?t=1755522488\" width=798 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/7fced742dd4d318e12fa946ad71d6557.webm?t=1755522488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/7fced742dd4d318e12fa946ad71d6557.mp4?t=1755522488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were taken as a child.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ripped from your home and locked away in a hidden laboratory. You were different your parents knew it. The government knew it. And they wanted to use you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tested. Modified. Controlled. You were meant to be a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the experiment failed. Your powers were stolen, replicated, and twisted. Instead of strength, the military\u2019s project unleashed devastation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world collapsed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/9f81f268daed7a68f277f3f7ccf10dbe.avif?t=1755522488\" width=610 height=88 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d Open-World Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in a vast post-apocalyptic wasteland filled with zombies, hostile survivors, and the remnants of the military that created you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/e0f6ef34fc030a5ab68154afb1cd1806.poster.avif?t=1755522488\" width=800 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/e0f6ef34fc030a5ab68154afb1cd1806.webm?t=1755522488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/e0f6ef34fc030a5ab68154afb1cd1806.mp4?t=1755522488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/2281e0270cdaf3d2b9e3f4b989fc94c1.avif?t=1755522488\" width=610 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shatterland</strong> is a survival/exploration open-world zombie game featuring base-building, skill progression, and online co-op play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot, fight, and explore a shattered world while reclaiming your past.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Stylized Low-Poly World</strong><br>A unique visual style that brings clarity and charm to your survival journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d <strong>Survive Together</strong><br>Play solo or in online co-op. Team up to share resources, build stronger defenses, and face greater threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddf <strong>Fight to Survive</strong><br>Battle hordes of the undead, hostile survivors, and twisted military experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Loot &amp; Equip</strong><br>Find powerful firearms, melee weapons, and survival gear to improve your chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Vehicle System</strong><br>Repair, upgrade, and maintain vehicles to traverse the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd5\ufe0f <strong>Build &amp; Barricade</strong><br>Create safe zones anywhere. Fortify your shelter and hold out against the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Weather &amp; Day/Night Cycle</strong><br>Adapt to changing conditions where every hour brings new dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Skill-Based Progression</strong><br>Level up by surviving. Unlock new abilities and reclaim fragments of your stolen power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Trade &amp; Customize</strong><br>Barter with survivors, adjust difficulty, and tailor the experience to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
